cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mbsolver: Fast Maxwell-Bloch solvers for masers, superradiance and coherent pulse propagation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Anari
    given-names: Vahid
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2464-3989"
version: 0.3.1
date-released: 2026-10-15
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23407483
repository-code: "https://github.com/vahid-anari/mbsolver"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/mbsolver/"
abstract: >-
  Fast Maxwell-Bloch solvers in Python (numpy + numba) for astrophysical
  masers, superradiance and coherent pulse propagation: a one-dimensional
  two-level model with pump and boundary-field profiles, relaxation-time
  schedules, and the scaling from physical sample values to the solver's
  dimensionless parameters.
keywords:
  - Maxwell-Bloch equations
  - masers
  - superradiance
  - astrophysics
  - numerical simulation
